#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:139
#: 3a8c9267ed844fe98ce955e9ae22ca5e 8ae59b188d2442a7984ff5e7269a0e8b
#: 910072a701a24d9baa10403448c20b8b daba956d70f248189e544cf6b9e94c66
#: f04321a109a94f44b8d8beae5a9dad12 f10158ecdd0b470eb3274e4e9e498e57
msgid ""
"The RX2 pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RX2 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，支持所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的 "
"UART 连接）。但是，FPort 以此方式连接时仅能提供 RC 信号，不含数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:141
#: 530683cee98742fa938564f373b7078b 5cbdce274c004be28bea2a32be638270
#: 772cc344a0ea4ec884955fe3ac974951 8d8c874d2839449aa927ffe348159097
#: e48646bfaf134a16b1312a1bfd15ce49 fd872f1661f847a08ffac6540e7f34d9
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RX2 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART RX pin"
" for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL6 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"如需在 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中使用 CRSF 及内嵌数传，可将 RX2 引脚配置为真正的 UART2 RX 引脚，将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设为 「1」，使其成为 SERIAL6 端口的 RX "
"输入引脚，从而支持双向系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:143
#: 355d618fc20c4263810088bf39886a31 7042204851c14b5286d090e830bb94d4
