"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX2 pin, but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX2 引脚，但 SBUS 要求将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"设为 「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:149
#: 2e97dfbb54c84eb28df4acfddff62ac0 5a3725b0ff594d94b588f34b628d36b3
#: 7faaf169819740b5addf1e447d1ab589 9dc3a8a23dbd406c801f0acdb909e4c9
#: 9fd0bdecae5b479dbbefdfa307ff5da3 ece1f2edc53b4f068874c2ac34972c35
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX2 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>`"
" be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 TX2，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:151
#: 481a2e5d4891480ea50391d0b563ebfa 8ca85202b9224fa887adc7f00ec25d5f
#: 9eaba334c92b4c88935421c78923a105 b8870eed4a19430ba4e41c3be7814b47
#: c5df9cc248e64aa58ef65985736640da f9de3a6a75ad4107a45d672db4838ae5
