"CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to Rx6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除需连接 Rx6 外，还需要 TX2 连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>`"
" 设为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:153
#: 0230be10a4284f39a5faebdefbda0f92 18309ade17594bf9acd3b3f85e1f359d
