"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接至 TX2 并自动提供数传回传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-te.rst:155
#: 019b03a7fed2469fb62815bad49d7524 3b72ba56c8d1433db1e4e7f5756747d1
#: 4677e7f763f44367b618ce3bc365be37 8785134bd8024615bdffd4020953c299
#: afd5d056b9a1485e9c1777620b9393d2 b204b5d28f1846a9b4751275bd3ad794
